<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction two bln skr of five-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction two bln skr of five-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's National Debt Office invited bids on Wednesday for an auction of two billion crowns of five-year bonds.</p>
<p>Bids have to be entered by 1030 GMT on June 18.</p>
<p>					     Loan 1039</p>
<p>Auction date			     June 18</p>
<p>Maturity date			    April 12, 2002</p>
<p>Coupon  (pct)			    5.50</p>
<p>Amount to the market (billions)    2.0</p>
<p>Settlement date			  June 23, 1997</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
